; +-----------------------------------------+
; EXPERIMENTAL / UNPROVEN - demo forward-test only, not for real money yet.
; Built for XAUUSDm (3-digit quotes) on M1.
; Idea: take score >= 6 entries ONLY in the daily-trend direction
;   (D1 close vs rising/falling EMA50) with a wide fixed bracket
;   (SL = TP = 20000 points = $20) so the ~$0.31 spread is small vs the move.
;   Hedge chain, trailing, break-even and health/loss management are OFF.
; Real-tick backtest, Jan-Jun 2026, $2,000 per month, 0.01 lot:
;   +21.3% over 6 months, but only 3/6 months profitable
;   (Jan +32.6, Feb -12.0, Mar -8.3, Apr -15.6, May +6.3, Jun +18.4 %),
;   intra-month drawdown up to 36%. Same bracket without the D1 filter: -53.9%.
; Weakness: the D1 EMA50 lags - it gives back profit for weeks after a trend breaks.
; Requirements / warnings:
;   - Points assume a 3-digit gold quote (0.001). On a 2-digit symbol, 20000 points
;     = $200: divide SLValue/TPValue/ZonePoints/MaxSpreadPoints by 10 there.
;   - A $20 stop at the 0.01 minimum lot risks $20 per trade (2 trades max open):
;     use ~$2,000+ for ~1% risk per trade. Not suitable for small accounts.
;   - Needs a hedging account.
; 2025 check (generated ticks from real M1 bars - the broker has no real ticks before 2026):
;   +36.9% (8/12 months up, worst intra-month DD 19%).
;   Note: the design was derived from data that included 2025 - not a blind test.
; +-----------------------------------------+
